|
| Host name
|
Set Inet$HostName riscpc
Set Inet$LocalDomain internal
Set Inet$EtherDevice EtherX
Set Inet$EtherIPAddr 192.168.0.10
Set Inet$EtherIPMask 255.255.255.0
|
| Interface: Net100
|
RMEnsure EtherX 2.00 RMLoad System:Modules.Network.EtherX
IfConfig -e ex0 192.168.0.10 netmask 255.255.255.0
CheckError
Set Inet$EtherTypeA <Inet$EtherType>
|
| Loopback
|
IfConfig -e lo0 127.0.0.1
CheckError
Set Inet$EtherType <Inet$EtherTypeA>
Unset Inet$EtherTypeA
|
| Name resolver
|
Set Inet$Resolvers  192.168.0.1
Set Alias$InetLoadResolver "RMEnsure Resolver 0.48 RMLoad System:Modules.Network.Resolver"
|
| Routing
|
Route -e add default 192.168.0.1
CheckError
Run Choices:Internet.Routes
CheckError
Set Inet$IsGateway ""
Set Inet$RouteDOptions ""
|
| Access
|
IfThere Resources:$.Resources.ShareFS.!Boot then Run Resources:$.Resources.ShareFS.!Boot
RMFind Freeway 0.26 System:Modules.Network.Freeway
RMFind ShareFS 3.38 System:Modules.Network.Share+
SetEval Inet$KickFiler 1
